# Verify Agent Pack Quality

## When to Use
When you need to audit the agent pack for quality, completeness, and accuracy. Invoke by asking: "verify agent pack quality" or "audit agent pack docs".

## Expected File Structure

```
packages/agent-pack/src/
├── core/
│   ├── architecture.md          # Required (HIGH)
│   ├── cheatsheet.md            # Required (HIGH)
│   ├── patterns.md              # Required
│   └── principles.md            # Required
├── modules/
│   ├── pear.md                  # Required (HIGH)
│   ├── bare.md                  # Required (HIGH)
│   ├── hypercore.md             # Required (HIGH)
│   ├── hyperdb.md               # Required (HIGH)
│   ├── hyperdrive.md            # Required (HIGH)
│   ├── hyperswarm.md            # Required (HIGH)
│   ├── qvac.md                  # Required (HIGH)
│   ├── wdk.md                   # Required (MEDIUM)
│   └── expo-bare.md             # Required (MEDIUM)
├── recipes/
│   ├── p2p-data-sync.md         # Required
│   ├── local-inference.md       # Required
│   ├── offline-first-app.md     # Required
│   ├── file-sharing.md          # Required
│   ├── p2p-rpc.md               # Required
│   ├── qvac-tool-calling.md     # Required
│   ├── qvac-kv-cache.md         # Required
│   └── ...
├── skills/                      # Each with SKILL.md + resources/
└── components/                  # Reusable TypeScript components
```

## Module Doc Checklist

For each module file, verify:
- [ ] **Overview** — specific, not generic filler
- [ ] **Version Notes** — actual version number + date
- [ ] **Installation** — correct package name
- [ ] **Quick Start** — 10-20 lines of verified working code
- [ ] **Core Concepts** — at least 3 items
- [ ] **API Reference** — key methods with TypeScript signatures from `.d.ts`
- [ ] **Integration** — explains stack relationships
- [ ] **Common Patterns** — 2+ code examples
- [ ] **Pitfalls & Gotchas** — real issues, not generic
- [ ] **Resources** — valid links

## Recipe Doc Checklist

For each recipe file, verify:
- [ ] **Problem** — clearly stated (1-2 sentences)
- [ ] **Prerequisites** — actual module requirements
- [ ] **Solution** — step-by-step code
- [ ] **Full Example** — complete, copy-pasteable with imports
- [ ] **Variations** — at least 1 alternative
- [ ] **Troubleshooting** — real issues with symptoms + solutions

## Red Flags
- Generic descriptions, missing versions, placeholder URLs
- Code referencing undefined variables or missing imports
- Missing `await` on async operations
- Inconsistent API names vs actual package exports
- Wrong bare-rpc API (no `register()`, no `request(string)`, no `destroy()`)
- Missing `tools: true` in QVAC `loadModel()` for tool-calling models

## Steps

1. List all files in `packages/agent-pack/src/` — compare against expected structure
2. Check each module against checklist
3. Check each recipe against checklist
4. Cross-reference code examples with actual APIs and reference apps in `research/`
5. Generate verification report
